(7607105, 1230116, 50641, '<td valign="top">Actually I think this one is best in show.  The combination of the pastels, pearl and bokeh is really dreamy and the metal looks as if it''s encrusted with tiny gems. The very shallow dof keeps it mysterious. I keep coming back to ogle it.  What is the object?</td>', 'Actually I think this one is best in show.  The combination of the pastels, pearl and bokeh is really dreamy and the metal looks as if it''s encrusted with tiny gems. The very shallow dof keeps it mysterious. I keep coming back to ogle it.  What is the object?', '2019-01-06 00:17:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7607106, 1230068, 50641, '<td valign="top">So festive and the fisheye distortion adds to the carnival feeling. Very crisp for 1/15 shutter. Congratulations!</td>', 'So festive and the fisheye distortion adds to the carnival feeling. Very crisp for 1/15 shutter. Congratulations!', '2019-01-06 00:22:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7607107, 1230110, 50641, '<td valign="top">Absolutely iconic.  I like the low key-ness.  They look like tap shoes. And congrats on the color appropriate ribbon!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2019-01-06 00:24:22.</i></td>', 'Absolutely iconic.  I like the low key-ness.  They look like tap shoes. And congrats on the color appropriate ribbon!', '2019-01-06 00:23:26.000000', '2019-01-06 00:24:22.000000', 0);
